       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FX-WIRE-CALC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 INPUT-AMOUNT PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01 REFERENCE-RATE PIC 9(2)V9(4) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01 SETTLEMENT-RESULT PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
           MOVE 45.00 TO INPUT-AMOUNT.
           MOVE 1.1830 TO REFERENCE-RATE.
           COMPUTE SETTLEMENT-RESULT ROUNDED = INPUT-AMOUNT * REFERENCE-RATE.
           DISPLAY SETTLEMENT-RESULT.
           GOBACK.
